  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish Emergency Relief Fund (DERF), 2021-24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic objectives: The goal (impact level) of the DERF is to prevent loss of life and escalation of suffering among people affected by an acute humanitarian crisis. By establishing a pool of funds that is rapid, effective, and relevant, with integrity and flexibility (output level),  the DERF responds to acute humanitarian crisis situations and reaches affected populations by responding to their needs (outcome level).


&#x2018;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the DERF is to prevent loss of life and escalation of suffering among people affected by an acute humanitarian crisis. By establishing a pool of funds that is rapid, effective, and relevant, with integrity and flexibility (output level), the DERF responds to acute humanitarian crisis situations and reaches affected populations by responding to their needs (outcome level). Read more: https://www.cisu.dk/derf</narrative>
  </description>
